H2 noise sd 0.3: 20-way decoding of the held line after 10 / 50 / 200 silent ticks: 0.05 / 0.05 / 0.05;  H4 period-2 index J(t,t+1)-J(t,t+2) = +0.0000 (>= 0: no alternation)
